.TH SCHED_SETAFFINITY 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
sched_setaffinity \- sets a thread cpu affinity from a linux cpu bitmap of size bytes; process zero selects the caller
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sched.h>
.B int sched_setaffinity(pid_t process, size_t size, const void* mask);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Sets a thread CPU affinity from a Linux CPU bitmap of size bytes; process zero selects the caller.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR sched_setaffinity (2)
